<h2 id=3D"intuition---dp">Intuition - DP</h2>
<p>Let=E2=80=99s discuss how we would approach this problem as we did with =
other DP problems in this chapter.</p>
<p>An important observation is that every possible subarray ends at a certa=
in index. This inversely means each index signifies the end of several suba=
rrays, one of which will have the maximum subarray sum (shortened to =E2=80=
